WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.701
CNN is now learning FBI

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.937
special agents across the country

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.572
are actively looking for

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.974
possible domestic terrorist threats

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.876
related to Trump's upcoming court.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.644
Appearance in Florida.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.747
Sources say some pro-Trump groups

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.248
are already making plans

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.716
to travel to Miami

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:17.283
and support

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.352
the former president as he faces

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.820
these federal charges

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.056
in the classified documents case.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:23.490
CNN's

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.025
Josh Campbell is joining us right now.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.493
Josh, I know you've been talking

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.661
to your sources in the FBI and elsewhere.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:31.231
What more are you hearing?

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.265
Well, Wolf, this is so important

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.033
because we know that

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.700
Donald Trump's

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.101
election lies inspired

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.037
that deadly January six insurrection

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:37.871
at the Capitol

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.772
and US federal law

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:40.740
enforcement is working to make sure

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.008
that that doesn't happen again.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:43.443
I spoke to five law enforcement

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.145
sources across the country today

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:45.645
who said that

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.679
FBI, domestic

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.481
terrorism agents and analysts

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.350
are actively working to identify

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.451
any potential threats

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.952
surrounding that cub coming

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:53.787
court appearance.

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:55.989
They are looking at online platforms

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.891
that are popular with extremist groups.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:58.558
This is important.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.160
They are also querying

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.960
and tasking

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.562
confidential human informants

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.230
who report on these domestic

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.365
terrorism groups now

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:07.333
as secretive and closed off

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.701
as these groups think they are.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.403
They are infiltrated by

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.738
informants of the FBI.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.606
That is often led to consternation

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:15.008
among these extremist groups,

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.143
as well as infighting and paranoia.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:17.544
By the way,

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:18.878
I'm told the FBI doesn't mind

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:20.580
that one bed at this point.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.548
There's no indication

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:23.583
of any credible and specific threat.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.151
But FBI agents and intelligence

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.820
analysts are certainly looking

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:27.954
for those potential threats.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:29.856
One source told me that they don't

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.124
want to see the same violence

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.892
on January six happen

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.160
this coming Tuesday Wolf.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.261
Yeah, no one does.

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:36.696
And Josh, I understand

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:37.564
we are learning

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:39.032
new details about the U.S.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.200
Secret Service

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.569
and their planned posture next week.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:44.003
That's right, Wolf.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:44.304
The U.S.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:45.572
Secret Service issued a statement

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:46.473
a short time ago

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:47.841
saying that they won't be asking

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.909
for any special precautions

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:52.479
to be taken surrounded by Trump's visit

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:54.114
to that courthouse on Tuesday.

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.381
But, you know, this is so important.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.650
Their mission is to protect Donald Trump.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.452
And we know that these extremist groups,

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:00.220
they're not going to target

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.087
the former president.

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:03.556
They're adherents of his message.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.258
But the question comes down to

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:06.459
what about everyone else?

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.093
What about the people

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.394
who work in that courthouse?

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:09.129
What about members

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.330
