00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.198
who we know have faced threats?

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:13.233
And so that's why

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.734
this work by federal law enforcement

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:16.302
is so important across the country,

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:17.337
trying to determine

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.571
are there potential threats

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:19.706
looking online, looking,

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:20.773
you know, talking to sources,

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:22.509
anyone who might have information.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:23.443
Federal law enforcement

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:25.578
will certainly respect First Amendment

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:27.614
protected activity at the courthouse

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:28.848
if people want to come and protest

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:29.883
and support Donald Trump.

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:30.984
But something they certainly won't

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:31.985
abide in any violence.

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:33.052
So we're told they're working

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.320
to try to disrupt, dismantle

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:34.988
any types of groups

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:36.623
who might be planning that Wolf.

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:37.924
Yeah, the last thing we need right now

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:40.160
is another January six type insurrection

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.427
over in Miami.

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:41.995
All right.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.763
Aaron, over to you. Absolutely.

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:43.897
All right.

